From: mckenna654 <mckenna654@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 20:22:51 +1100
Subject: Autosave at story goals, brighter map colours, goals that follow
 people

- The game saves by itself whenever a story goal is completed.
- Tileset palettes are made more saturated and slightly brighter on load.
- Goals aimed at a person look the person up at run time (scripts move them);
  Bill's cottage is split into its three steps.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>

